  "content": {
    "id": "p14-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "For positive whole numbers $a$ and $b$, prove that:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "if $\\frac{a}{b}<1$ then $\\frac{a+1}{b+1}>\\frac{a}{b}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Since $a<b$ and $b(b+1)>0$,\n\n$\\displaystyle\\frac{a+1}{b+1}-\\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{b-a}{b(b+1)}>0$.\n\nHence $\\frac{a+1}{b+1}>\\frac{a}{b}$.",
          "worked": "Since $b>0$, the hypothesis $\\frac{a}{b}<1$ gives $a<b$. Thus $b-a>0$, and $b(b+1)>0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a+1}{b+1}-\\frac{a}{b}&=\\frac{b(a+1)-a(b+1)}{b(b+1)}\\\\\\frac{a+1}{b+1}-\\frac{a}{b}&=\\frac{ab+b-ab-a}{b(b+1)}\\\\\\frac{a+1}{b+1}-\\frac{a}{b}&=\\frac{b-a}{b(b+1)}>0\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore $\\frac{a+1}{b+1}>\\frac{a}{b}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "if $\\frac{a}{b}>1$ then $\\frac{a+1}{b+1}<\\frac{a}{b}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Since $a>b$ and $b(b+1)>0$,\n\n$\\displaystyle\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{a+1}{b+1}=\\frac{a-b}{b(b+1)}>0$.\n\nHence $\\frac{a+1}{b+1}<\\frac{a}{b}$.",
          "worked": "Since $b>0$, the hypothesis $\\frac{a}{b}>1$ gives $a>b$. Thus $a-b>0$, and $b(b+1)>0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{a+1}{b+1}&=\\frac{a(b+1)-b(a+1)}{b(b+1)}\\\\\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{a+1}{b+1}&=\\frac{ab+a-ab-b}{b(b+1)}\\\\\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{a+1}{b+1}&=\\frac{a-b}{b(b+1)}>0\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore $\\frac{a+1}{b+1}<\\frac{a}{b}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 62
      }
    ]
